{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"[color=#FF0000][b]Đây là những tài liệu VIP, chúng tôi đã kỳ công biên tập (hoặc mua .CBL bên Trung Quốc với giá không hề thấp).\r\nChúng tôi bán lại file với một mức chi phí hợp lý để duy trì hoạt động của Web Cờ Tướng.\r\nRất mong mọi người không đăng tải công khai những tài liệu này lên mạng xã hội.\r\nNếu bạn cần mua những tài liệu VIP khác, vui lòng liên hệ\r\nhttps://m.me/tieututhichco hoặc số điện thoại: 093.365.8383\r\nCảm ơn sự ủng hộ của các bạn![/b][/color]\r\n\r\n\r\n","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":" 1951年至1955年间，岭南双英杨官璘、陈松顺联袂由粤来沪，在大世界、大新公司等游乐场公开献技。夏来冬去，他们的高超棋艺，不仅吸引了上海的广大棋迷，并且引来了全国各地名手来沪交流。\r\n 本局表演赛是在上海老城煌庙内春风得意茶楼举行的，由朱先行，杨以顺炮应战。布局阶段双方对攻激烈，黑方在复杂局势下，施出献车弃子恶手。红方不走平稳之路，导致受攻，最后阶段由于应变失误，造成不利残局而败北。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8d8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d8d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2c2","comment":" 忙于抢先出动左翼子力，但黑车平7后，自己的马双炮也受影响，并不合算。应走车二平三，炮5 退1，兵三进一，仍保持先行之利。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6c6","comment":" 宜走炮五进三打中卒，破坏黑方盘头马的反击。以下黑方可能接走马7进5，则炮五进二，炮2平5，车八进三，马3退2，相三进五，马2进3，兵七进一，红方局势不坏。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6a5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2d2","comment":" 卸中炮嫌软，导致中线被突破，不如改走兵五进一较为有益。以下黑如接走：(一)卒5进1，炮五进四，马7进5，车七平五，车7进1，相三进五，车7退1，车五退二，红势不差。\r\n (二)马5进7，兵五进一，马7进6，兵五平六，士4进5，车七平四，马6进4，帅五平四，车7进1，士五进六，车7进2，帅四进一，黑方盘马攻势消失，右翼主力不活，红方亦不错。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4b9","comment":" 如图形势，黑方弃中卒，盘马出击与过河车配合，但红车扼守将门线，黑方攻势尚难以得逞。同同时右翼黑车炮被封，长久相持,显然不利，乃平炮猝施恶手，既解困又可破坏红方阵形，展开新的进攻，红吃车贪攻，造成不利局势，应该平车拦炮较好。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5f1","comment":" 只好退车,如帅五平四,则卒7进1，车四进一，士6进5，车八退四，炮5平6，士五进四，象7进9，以后7路黑马从8路跃出，红难固守。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3i3","comment":" 吃边兵,利于中炮平8路,从红方底线进攻,如图,黑方车双马炮配合作战,而红一马在边,一时不能配合双车防守,红局面不利。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4g4","comment":" 如改走士五进四，车9进3，帅五进一，车9平7，帅五平六(如前车平三，马6退5，车三退三，马5进4，马后炮成杀)，马